<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2241_8477.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser früntlich willig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dienst</unclear>, unnd was wir ehren,
<lb n="2"/>liebs unnd guots vermögend zuovor, fromm, fürsichtig,
<lb n="3"/>ehrsam, wyß, innsonders guot fründt, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getrüwe</unclear> lieb
<lb n="4"/><orgName resp="#ner">Eidtgnossen</orgName>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wiewol</unclear> wir inn hoffnung ge=
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">standen</unclear>, das es by der durch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rychs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Stett</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verschinens</unclear>
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frülings</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemachten</unclear>, unnd hernach durch unns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> an=
