<lb n="13"/>hierby noch nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beruowen</unclear>, sonders man <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hin</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">her</unclear> mit
