<lb n="37"/>unß samptlich goetlichem schirm beuelchend.
<lb n="38"/>Datum <origDate when="1620" resp="#ner">den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">18</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nouembris</unclear>, anno 1620</origDate>.
